        "description": "A compact old town of pastel squares, a four-towered castle and a UFO-topped bridge.",
        "details": "Bratislava Old Town is walkable, with St Michael Gate, the Primate Palace and statues on corners. The castle above the Danube gives views toward Austria and Hungary. The UFO observation deck on the bridge is a quirky stop. Try bryndzove halusky, sheep cheese dumplings.",
